course: dictionary
lesson: 11583
title: Science words and their clues
level: primary-5
stars: 2
explain: Some words come from science, and they seem hard at first. Context helps you crack them. «Anterior» is one of these words. It means at or near the front, especially of the body. Its opposite is posterior, which means at the back.
explain: Read this: «The doctor checked the anterior part of the dog, near its nose and chest.» The clues are nose and chest, which are at the front. So anterior means front. Test it: "the front part of the dog" fits the sentence, so your meaning is right.
explain: Anterior can also mean earlier in time, but this use is very formal. «The anterior chapters of the book describe the king's childhood.» The chapters are the first part of the story, so anterior means earlier. Read the words around the word to decide which meaning fits.
explain: In sport and medicine, anterior appears in a real name: the anterior cruciate ligament, or ACL. It is a strong band inside the knee. Footballers and netball players can injure it. When you learn a science word, look for its opposite too, as it helps you remember both.
fact: Anterior means at or near the front, especially of the body.
fact: Posterior means at or near the back, so it is the opposite of anterior.
fact: «Anterior» can also mean earlier in time, in very formal writing.
fact: The anterior cruciate ligament, or ACL, is a band inside the knee that is often injured in sport.
fact: Science words often come in pairs with opposites, such as anterior and posterior, so learn them together.
exercise: «The anterior fin of the fish is near its head.» Where is the anterior fin? | In the middle of the belly | At the back of the tail | *At the front, near the head | Under the water only
exercise: «The anterior chapters of the book were written first.» What does anterior mean here? | Funny | *Earlier in time | Lost | Last
exercise: Which word means the opposite of anterior, at the back? | Outer | Side | *Posterior | Middle
test: «The doctor pointed to the anterior of the dog, its front end.» What is the anterior of something? | *Its front | Its shadow | Its inside corner | Its tail
test: Ella hurt her ACL when she landed badly in netball. What is the ACL? | A kind of shoe | A sort of cloud | *A strong band inside the knee | A type of ball
exam: «The anterior wall of the house faces the road.» What does anterior mean in this sentence? | Back | *Front | Roof | Inside
